    "description": "Nestled among 97 hectares of tropical forest, this luxury resort on the Yucatán Peninsula is 1.6 km from the nearest beach and 10 km from the Riviera Art Gallery.\nThe warm, refined rooms offer free Wi-Fi, flat-screen TVs and tea and coffeemakers, plus balconies/terraces with scenic views. Suites add separate living/dining areas and marble bathrooms; upgraded suites add private infinity pools. Room service is available; some upgraded units add private butler service.\nAmenities include 4 restaurants, a cafe and 3 bars (1 swim-up). There are 5 pools, plus a gym and a spa. Guests also have access to a nearby beach and golf club. Breakfast is extra."
